87:{character:Kana Fujita}Um, Miss Manager...
88:{character:Manager}Well, I'll agree to it since Kana insists... I'll leave it to you.
89:That's why I've hurried over here to Kana's home on a weekday. As for why I have to inspect my backpack so carefully, this is just something I've learned from my experiences in my battle of wits with Kana these few days to ensure the weight loss plan progresses well.
90:After making sure I don't have any high-calorie foods on me, I knock on Kana's front door gently.
91:{character:Kana Fujita}Coming! {var:player_nickname}, good afternoon!
92:Kana's joyful voice on the other side of the door is followed by a clanging sound like many things have been knocked down at the same time. Fortunately, the door opens soon, revealing Kana's smiling face.
