155:{character:Kana Fujita}Of course not. I already feel bad that I can't try that delicious fried chicken rice bowl. It'll be even harder for me to stomach this food if I can't see you while I'm eating, {var:player_nickname}.
156:{character:player}I think I know what to give you after your concert ends, a bouquet of fried chicken drumsticks would be perfect.
157:{character:Kana Fujita}Haha! I don't mind, but my manager will definitely stop you. Sigh... I feel miserable whenever I remember that I'll have to wait until after my concert ends three months later before I can eat meat again.
158:The young girl leans softly against the back of the chair and pokes the food in her bowl with her fork instead of eating the food.
159:Seeing how depressed she looks, the angel in my heart stands up again with shaky legs and starts chanting a magic spell while waving a staff around. Because I want to remove the frown from her face so much, the magic spell enchants me easily.
