165:{character:player}Wait, Kana! That's the spoon I was using...
166:Her face becomes as red as a beetroot. She quickly thrusts the spoon back into my hand, then turns around so her back is facing me and picks up the salad set she was eating before. The vegetables she disliked so much before are now like delicacies that have her full attention.
167:Her actions remind me of a video compilation of cute little squirrels on CatChat. In my heart, I feel a little lucky and proud because only I have seen such a vivid side of her.
168:It's just... I press my hand against my cheek and realize that Kana isn't the only person affected by what happened.
