171:{character:player}Yes, he just sent me a message saying that he can't come today because something happened at home.
172:{character:Kana Fujita}Heaven must have noticed that I was working too hard and decided to give me an extra day off. Why don't we go and play mahjong with Ichihime and the others in the afternoon? I've been exercising so hard during this time that I haven't played a South Wind match in a long time.
174:{character:Kana Fujita}{var:player_nickname}, you suddenly pulled out something terrifying!
175:{character:player}I won't let you take any days off unless you reach the target weight.
176:{character:Kana Fujita}Ahem, I was just joking. I'll exercise seriously, so put the electronic scale away now... Since you insist, you can be my trainer for today!
177:{character:Kana Fujita}Why are you so surprised? You've been supervising me while I exercise these last few days, so you should be really familiar with the exercises the trainer has been teaching me. There's also the training video my manager recorded at home to help you. You can do this!
178:Kana interrupts my instinctive refusal. After hearing her analysis, I actually begin to approve of this plan. At least this really is the best course of action we can take to save time and keep up with the weight loss plan.
