182:{character:player}That sounds like a good idea, but... you didn't make this suggestion because you want to see me out of breath after exercising, right?
183:{character:Kana Fujita}Ahem, no way. Exercise is an important part of life, and I want to share this healthy lifestyle with you. Shall we start now?
184:Seeing that she was starting to convince me, Kana quickly finds the recorded training video and even sets up an exercise mat for me. Perhaps it's merely an illusion, but I sense a mischievous sparkle in her eyes.
