186:I still feel okay after exercising for one minute... After five minutes, it starts to feel strenuous... After ten minutes, I am sweating profusely and feel like my whole body is soaking in water.
187:Most of the movements in the video look simple but are actually really difficult. It is an epic disaster for a beginner like me.
188:I can clearly feel that I am losing control of my arms and legs. The sound of my heavy panting gradually becomes louder than the background music of the training video. I'm afraid I would have given up ages ago if it wasn't for the fact that I didn't want to embarrass myself in front of Kana. When I finally survive until it is time for a break, I plunge my head into the sofa and don't want to stand for even a second longer.
189:{character:player}Huff... Huff... Huff...
190:{character:Kana Fujita}Are you okay? Do you want to have some water? There's some warm water here.
