193:{character:player}Did your manager also make arrangements for Mia to lose weight?
194:{character:Kana Fujita}No, but everyone was practicing a new dance when W.I.N first debuted, and I could continue to dance to the music even after Mia and Akane were too tired to move. That's why she said that.
195:{character:Kana Fujita}"Why do you have such an unreasonable fitness level when you're clearly a gamer?" Haha, that's what she said.
196:{character:Kana Fujita}To meet the boss' requirements, we trained up to 12 hours a day during that time... It feels really nostalgic now that I think about it.
